{"server":"tw","storyId":"story_bldsk_set_1_story_1","groupId":"story_bldsk_set_1","stageId":null,"title":"怪物","storyCode":null,"avgTag":"幕間","sourcePath":"vendor/ArknightsGamedata/tw/gamedata/story/obt/memory/story_bldsk_1_1.txt","sourceHash":"e7c53a2ebd84da6aa247edd91142395bf3692a23ad6d64dc415c2454c932b7ed","bodyAvailable":true,"blocks":[{"type":"narration","text":"个人剧情 华法琳"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_black"},{"type":"narration","text":"10:32 P. M. 天氣/小雨\n切爾諾伯格 戰後廢墟"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_cher_3"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"勇敢的孩子","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"喂——喂！有人嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"勇敢的孩子","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"勇敢的孩子","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"天變得好黑......剛剛走過了學校、蛋糕店、羅蓮娜媽媽的裁縫鋪子......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"勇敢的孩子","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"再往前的話，就要過了這個街區了吧？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"勇敢的孩子","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"混蛋......路越來越不像路，都怪那幫戴面具的瘋子，突然之間什麼都不一樣了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"勇敢的孩子","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"尤里——尤里！你在這裡嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"勇敢的孩子","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"明明剛才還在一起......我只是去找能喝的水了啊！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"勇敢的孩子","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"尤里年紀最小，傷得最重，一個人能走到哪裡去？對了，他的傷還在流血......血的味道......嗚......到處都是血的味道。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"勇敢的孩子","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"嘔，好臭。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"勇敢的孩子","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"不行，不能吐出來。這是奧列格哥哥好不容易從廢墟裡找來的晚餐。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"勇敢的孩子","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"尤里——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_storehouse"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"嗚......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"勇敢的孩子","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"牆後面有聲音？會是小動物嗎？嘁，不可能的。除了我們，這條街上的活物早跑光啦。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"嗚嗚......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"勇敢的孩子","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"又聽見了。不像是風聲啊。難道真的是......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"勇敢的孩子","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"尤里，尤里？是你嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"勇敢的孩子","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"沒動靜了。是不是太遠了？這牆後面......是百貨商場的舊倉庫？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"勇敢的孩子","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"這倉庫一直空著，大人們從來不許我們靠近。以前奧列格還說，要帶我們來偷偷溜進門。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"勇敢的孩子","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"尤里不會一個人到這來吧？牆縫裡黑漆漆的，什麼都看不清。可惡，還是得爬進去看看。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"勇敢的孩子","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"裡面更黑了。臉上黏糊糊的，是外頭飄進來的雨嗎？......腥腥的......嘔。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"勇敢的孩子","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"想起來了......學校裡的幾個女同學都說，這倉庫裡有怪東西。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"勇敢的孩子","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"......假的，一定是假的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"勇敢的孩子","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"可是......這幾天見到的怪事還不夠多嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"勇敢的孩子","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"不行，現在不是想這個的時候。安東，你可不能害怕。你還要找到尤里呢。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"嗚嗚......嗚......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"勇敢的孩子","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"是哭聲！另一頭有人在哭！這回可總算聽清楚啦。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"勇敢的孩子","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"尤里，是你在哭嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"害怕的孩子","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"安東......安東？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"勇敢的孩子","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"是我，對的，是我。我來啦。你別害怕，我馬上就能爬到你那去。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"害怕的孩子","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"救我......救救我......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"勇敢的孩子","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"撐住，我就快到了。不過剛才到底發生了什麼事啊？你為什麼會突然自己跑這麼遠？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"勇敢的孩子","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"你的腿......你的腿不是受傷了嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"害怕的孩子","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"嗚啊......有，有怪物......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"勇敢的孩子","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"怪物？你胡說什麼啊尤里？你是不是發燒啦？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"害怕的孩子","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"是怪物......把我抓來......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"勇敢的孩子","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"勇敢的孩子","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"你說的怪物，它長什麼樣子？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"害怕的孩子","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"我......我沒看清楚......它好像有、有漆黑的爪子......還有血紅色的眼睛！它盯著我，我、我太害怕，一下就什麼都不知道了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"勇敢的孩子","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"黑爪子，紅眼睛？我在哪裡聽過。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"勇敢的孩子","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"對啦，就是那個，是學校裡的莉娜說的鬼故事吧？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"害怕的孩子","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"嗯......莉娜說......莉娜說，如果有小孩子晚上不睡覺，怪物就會爬到你床邊。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"害怕的孩子","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"它一直盯著你，你的眼睛要是也睜著，對上它的紅眼睛，你的魂就會被瞬間吸走。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"害怕的孩子","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"你會變成牽線木偶一樣，跟著它爬下床，從家裡走出去，走到大街上......跟著它來到它的巢穴裡。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"害怕的孩子","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"在那裡，它會把你吊起來......就像我們平常家裡曬的肉腸一樣，吊在屋簷下......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"害怕的孩子","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"等它餓了......餓了就來吸一口血，一口一口，直到把你身體裡的血吸乾。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"害怕的孩子","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"嗚嗚......安東，我是不是也會......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"勇敢的孩子","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"......別嚇唬自己。這都是大人編出來騙人的。他們只是想讓我們早點睡覺，對，肯定是這樣。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"害怕的孩子","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"真、真的嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"勇敢的孩子","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"你想想，難道你現在真的被吊著嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"害怕的孩子","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"我......有東西正抓著我的腿......在很高的地方......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"勇敢的孩子","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"......什麼？！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"害怕的孩子","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"所以......莉娜說的都是真的吧？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"害怕的孩子","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"嗚嗚嗚......安東......我不想被怪物吃掉......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"勇敢的孩子","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"沒事的，我就快到了。只要更快一點，在那怪......在那不管是什麼東西回來之前，我一定能把你背回去。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"害怕的孩子","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"好......不，不好......安東，你不要過來，你快點回去吧！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"勇敢的孩子","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"我已經看到你了，尤里——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"勇敢的孩子","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"這是什麼？！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"勇敢的孩子","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"啊啊啊——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"char_171_bldsk","isRemote":false,"text":"抓住你了哦。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"勇敢的孩子","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"不要過來......你不許過來！我......我不許你傷害尤里！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"char_171_bldsk","isRemote":false,"text":"我，傷害他？小朋友，你覺得我想做什麼？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"勇敢的孩子","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"你想吸血，你這個吸血怪物！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"char_171_bldsk","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯，好久沒聽到有人這麼叫我了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"char_171_bldsk","isRemote":false,"text":"是呀是呀，沒錯，我是血魔哦。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"char_171_bldsk","isRemote":false,"text":"哎呀，看起來挺瘦弱的，反應不慢嘛？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"char_171_bldsk","isRemote":false,"text":"不過啊，朝我丟藏起來的磚頭是遠遠不夠的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"char_171_bldsk","isRemote":false,"text":"我可是血魔啊，血魔！我們的速度很快，力氣在魔族當中也數一數二，還有哦，看到我的牙了嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"char_171_bldsk","isRemote":false,"text":"我可以輕輕鬆鬆撕開一隻瘤獸的脖頸。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"勇敢的孩子","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"char_171_bldsk","isRemote":false,"text":"不動了啊？明智之選。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"勇敢的孩子","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"怪物，你放了尤里。他受傷了，流了不少血，剩下的一定沒我多。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"勇敢的孩子","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"你可以把我吊起來，等餓了的時候就喝我的血。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"害怕的孩子","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"不要，安東......這不行的......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"char_171_bldsk","isRemote":false,"text":"好吧，既然你都找到這裡了。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"勇敢的孩子","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"......好快！手一下就動不了了......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"勇敢的孩子","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"唔......疼！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"勇敢的孩子","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"根本躲不開......這就是......被咬的感覺嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"char_171_bldsk","isRemote":false,"text":"好了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"勇敢的孩子","speakerId":"char_171_bldsk","isRemote":false,"text":"......好了？我還站著......也沒有覺得很頭暈......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"char_171_bldsk","isRemote":false,"text":"就這一點點血，你身體好著呢，不會有什麼副作用。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"勇敢的孩子","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"那，你是要把我抓住......當肉腸嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"char_171_bldsk","isRemote":false,"text":"肉腸？烏薩斯特產嗎，聽起來味道還不錯的樣子。等加完這趟班，還有機會來的話，下次可以嘗嘗看。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"勇敢的孩子","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"char_171_bldsk","isRemote":false,"text":"圓規先生？圓規先生你還在嗎？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"近衛幹員","speakerId":"avg_npc_012","isRemote":false,"text":"咳咳，華法琳醫生，我在。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"華法琳","speakerId":"char_171_bldsk","isRemote":false,"text":"我忙得快要累死啦，你倒好，一直在旁邊躲著看戲。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"近衛幹員","speakerId":"avg_npc_012","isRemote":false,"text":"哈哈，我這不是也剛過來不久嘛。再說了，華法琳醫生明明看起來相當樂在其中啊。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"勇敢的孩子","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"醫......生？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"勇敢的孩子","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"你是說，這個吸血怪物是醫生？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"華法琳","speakerId":"char_171_bldsk","isRemote":false,"text":"你看看呀，圓規先生，這孩子一口一個吸血怪物地叫我。只是稍微嚇唬一下他們，我已經做得夠仁慈了吧？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"勇敢的孩子","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"嚇唬......我們？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"近衛幹員","speakerId":"avg_npc_012","isRemote":false,"text":"還是我來解釋一下吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"近衛幹員","speakerId":"avg_npc_012","isRemote":false,"text":"小朋友，是我在執行任務時候發現了你的朋友。當時只有他一個人在，他看上去還受了不輕的傷。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"近衛幹員","speakerId":"avg_npc_012","isRemote":false,"text":"我擔心他獨自在外不安全，就把他帶了回來。他一直昏昏沉沉，中途徹底暈了過去，我也沒辦法多解釋什麼。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"近衛幹員","speakerId":"avg_npc_012","isRemote":false,"text":"華法琳醫生是我們最好的醫生之一，她的經驗很豐富。你可以放心讓她醫治你的朋友。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"近衛幹員","speakerId":"avg_npc_012","isRemote":false,"text":"哦對了，還有，剛才她抽了你的一點血，應該只是為了做下檢驗而已。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"勇敢的孩子","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"......檢驗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"華法琳","speakerId":"char_171_bldsk","isRemote":false,"text":"好啦，結果出來了。那句烏薩俚語怎麼說的來著？嗯，這個年輕人結實得跟個野生馱獸差不多。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"華法琳","speakerId":"char_171_bldsk","isRemote":false,"text":"恭喜你，小朋友，你現在還沒有被感染。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"勇敢的孩子","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"感染......感染礦石病嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"華法琳","speakerId":"char_171_bldsk","isRemote":false,"text":"是呀。在如今的切爾諾伯格，還活著而且沒有被感染的人，已經是幸運中的幸運了吧？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"華法琳","speakerId":"char_171_bldsk","isRemote":false,"text":"像你的朋友，情況就不那麼妙了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"勇敢的孩子","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"尤里他怎麼樣了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"華法琳","speakerId":"char_171_bldsk","isRemote":false,"text":"只能說，處理得還不算太晚。畢竟有我在呀。要是換了亞葉什麼的負責這片區域，恐怕就沒法做得像我這麼漂亮了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"近衛幹員","speakerId":"avg_npc_012","isRemote":false,"text":"咳咳，這話讓亞葉醫生聽見了，她一定會發火的吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"華法琳","speakerId":"char_171_bldsk","isRemote":false,"text":"不爽又怎樣？她還有得學呢。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"華法琳","speakerId":"char_171_bldsk","isRemote":false,"text":"她能像我一樣透過血液氣味的變化第一時間確定源石結晶在體內的聚積方向嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"華法琳","speakerId":"char_171_bldsk","isRemote":false,"text":"像這種剛出現感染跡象的病人，除了儘快處理傷口來控制進一步感染，還需要防止已經進入體內的源石在傷處形成固化病灶。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"華法琳","speakerId":"char_171_bldsk","isRemote":false,"text":"市面上的抑制劑只能緩解症狀。就算我來處理，也就是儘量把病人的惡化風險控制到一個相對低值而已。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"勇敢的孩子","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"你把尤里的傷腿像這樣吊起來，也是為了救他嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"華法琳","speakerId":"char_171_bldsk","isRemote":false,"text":"這個嘛......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"華法琳","speakerId":"char_171_bldsk","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯......算是吧？這個方法我一直想試試來著，從今天這個病例來看，效率可能是有幾個百分點的提升......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"華法琳","speakerId":"char_171_bldsk","isRemote":false,"text":"或者只是誤差？哎呀，果然還是需要再多找幾個人實驗......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"近衛幹員","speakerId":"avg_npc_012","isRemote":false,"text":"咳咳，華法琳醫生，你再說下去，兩位年輕人又要瑟瑟發抖了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"害怕的孩子","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"嗚......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"勇敢的孩子","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"這麼說，你救了我們。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"勇敢的孩子","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"......謝謝。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"華法琳","speakerId":"char_171_bldsk","isRemote":false,"text":"謝倒是不用急著謝。你的朋友，這個叫尤里的孩子，他的後續情況還需要好好觀察。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"華法琳","speakerId":"char_171_bldsk","isRemote":false,"text":"如果真的成了感染者......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"華法琳","speakerId":"char_171_bldsk","isRemote":false,"text":"算了，先不說這麼多了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"近衛幹員","speakerId":"avg_npc_012","isRemote":false,"text":"安東小朋友，你可以先陪尤里小朋友休息一會。等天亮了，我會負責把你們送去營地。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"勇敢的孩子","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"營地？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"近衛幹員","speakerId":"avg_npc_012","isRemote":false,"text":"是的，營地。我們很快就會從切爾諾伯格撤退，到時候可以護送你們一道離開，去附近的烏薩斯城市。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"近衛幹員","speakerId":"avg_npc_012","isRemote":false,"text":"......假如尤里小朋友並沒有出現進一步感染症狀的話。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"勇敢的孩子","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"還有奧列格他們。我們有五個人，我們要在一起。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"近衛幹員","speakerId":"avg_npc_012","isRemote":false,"text":"這樣嗎？很好。那我會先去找他們，華法琳醫生也會替他們檢查身體。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"近衛幹員","speakerId":"avg_npc_012","isRemote":false,"text":"能一直在一起的話，好好生活下去的希望也能更大一些。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_storehouse"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"勇敢的孩子","speakerId":"char_171_bldsk","isRemote":false,"text":"......醫生？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"華法琳","speakerId":"char_171_bldsk","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"勇敢的孩子","speakerId":"char_171_bldsk","isRemote":false,"text":"我還有一個問題......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"華法琳","speakerId":"char_171_bldsk","isRemote":false,"text":"什麼問題？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"勇敢的孩子","speakerId":"char_171_bldsk","isRemote":false,"text":"你......真的是吸血怪物嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"近衛幹員","speakerId":"avg_npc_012","isRemote":false,"text":"咳，咳咳。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"華法琳","speakerId":"char_171_bldsk","isRemote":false,"text":"（齜牙）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"勇敢的孩子","speakerId":"char_171_bldsk","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"近衛幹員","speakerId":"avg_npc_012","isRemote":false,"text":"想後退嗎？居然忍住了啊，真是個勇敢的孩子。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"近衛幹員","speakerId":"avg_npc_012","isRemote":false,"text":"說實話，雖然我認識華法琳醫生這麼久了，知道她是個有些不正經......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"華法琳","speakerId":"char_171_bldsk","isRemote":false,"text":"喂喂！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"近衛幹員","speakerId":"avg_npc_012","isRemote":false,"text":"咳咳，是個醫術十分高超的好醫生，但偶爾......偶爾被突然綁上手術台的時候，也難免會有些脊背發涼。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"華法琳","speakerId":"char_171_bldsk","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯，這是本能啦，我會原諒你的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"華法琳","speakerId":"char_171_bldsk","isRemote":false,"text":"就像沙蟲遇到磐蟹，別的小型肉獸遇到更兇猛的野獸，你們遇到血魔的話，當然也會害怕。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"華法琳","speakerId":"char_171_bldsk","isRemote":false,"text":"而且最好保持害怕比較好哦。到了外面的話，像我和可露希爾這麼好的血魔可不多見呀。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"近衛幹員","speakerId":"avg_npc_012","isRemote":false,"text":"哈......哈哈。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"華法琳","speakerId":"char_171_bldsk","isRemote":false,"text":"唔......回到這位小朋友的問題上——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"華法琳","speakerId":"char_171_bldsk","isRemote":false,"text":"算一半一半吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"勇敢的孩子","speakerId":"char_171_bldsk","isRemote":false,"text":"一半一半？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"華法琳","speakerId":"char_171_bldsk","isRemote":false,"text":"我現在對血液的興趣不再表現在食用的渴望上了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"勇敢的孩子","speakerId":"char_171_bldsk","isRemote":false,"text":"那......怪物？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"勇敢的孩子","speakerId":"char_171_bldsk","isRemote":false,"text":"你把自己叫做怪物......你不生氣嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"華法琳","speakerId":"char_171_bldsk","isRemote":false,"text":"這個嘛......對你們來說，我的確就是怪物吧？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"華法琳","speakerId":"char_171_bldsk","isRemote":false,"text":"我從未希望你們把我當成同類，我也並不會把其他種族看作同類。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"華法琳","speakerId":"char_171_bldsk","isRemote":false,"text":"更何況，如果只是和別人不一樣就會被視作怪物的話......每個人都有機會被叫做怪物。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"華法琳","speakerId":"char_171_bldsk","isRemote":false,"text":"比如說，萬一你的朋友尤里真的成了感染者，那很多人也會這麼叫他。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"勇敢的孩子","speakerId":"char_171_bldsk","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"勇敢的孩子","speakerId":"char_171_bldsk","isRemote":false,"text":"我不會。我不會叫他怪物。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"華法琳","speakerId":"char_171_bldsk","isRemote":false,"text":"其他人呢？你很難改變別人對他的看法。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"勇敢的孩子","speakerId":"char_171_bldsk","isRemote":false,"text":"如果他們非要叫尤里怪物，我會打跑他們。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"華法琳","speakerId":"char_171_bldsk","isRemote":false,"text":"看啦，你還是生氣了吧？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"華法琳","speakerId":"char_171_bldsk","isRemote":false,"text":"你打他們，他們就會打你。這麼打來打去的，就算不白費性命，也很浪費時間吧？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"勇敢的孩子","speakerId":"char_171_bldsk","isRemote":false,"text":"浪費......時間？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"華法琳","speakerId":"char_171_bldsk","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯，浪費時間。在你生氣的時候，你的朋友可能就會因為病重而死去。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"華法琳","speakerId":"char_171_bldsk","isRemote":false,"text":"慢慢地就會發現，與其生氣，還不如把精力花在思考別的更重要或者更有意思的事情上。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"華法琳","speakerId":"char_171_bldsk","isRemote":false,"text":"對你們來說的話，嗯......想想如何活下去？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"勇敢的孩子","speakerId":"char_171_bldsk","isRemote":false,"text":"活下去......是的，我們想活下去。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"華法琳","speakerId":"char_171_bldsk","isRemote":false,"text":"這就對啦！想要更好地生活，我們總要學著接受自己是異類的事實，然後找到與其他人相處的方法。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"華法琳","speakerId":"char_171_bldsk","isRemote":false,"text":"還有哦，小朋友，等你再長大一些，去更多的地方走一走、看一看......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"華法琳","speakerId":"char_171_bldsk","isRemote":false,"text":"或許，你就不會認為作為怪物是一件......值得讓人生氣的事情了吧？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"}],"observedOperators":[{"speakerId":"char_171_bldsk","aliases":["？？？","勇敢的孩子","華法琳"]}]}
